            [CompletionResult]::new('install', 'install', [CompletionResultType]::ParameterValue, 'Load a CAP file and install an applet over an SCP03 channel: INSTALL [for load], LOAD, INSTALL [for install and make selectable] (GlobalPlatform Card Spec v2.3.1 11.5, 11.6). CHANGES CARD CONTENT')
